Typical Instruments: Titanium-strung electric koto with piezoelectric bridge transducers, Roland JP-8000 supersaw synth, Yamaha DX7 running decaying electric piano patches, Akai S950 hardware samplers loaded with pitch-downed cassette rips, 432Hz sine-wave sub-oscillators, and contact microphones attached to hydraulic bulkheads.

